WEBVTT

00:00:33.924 --> 00:00:35.688
Very clean, these Muggles.

00:00:35.952 --> 00:00:37.670
- Tonks, for God's sake.
- Unnatural.

00:00:42.742 --> 00:00:43.825
Professor Moody.

00:00:44.284 --> 00:00:47.329
-What are you doing here?
-Rescuing you, of course.

00:00:50.207 --> 00:00:52.918
But where are we going?
The letter said I've been expelled.

00:00:53.085 --> 00:00:55.504
You haven't been. Not yet.
Kingsley, you take point.

00:00:55.671 --> 00:00:58.256
-But the letter said--
-Dumbledore persuaded the minister...

00:00:58.423 --> 00:01:00.842
...to suspend your expulsion,
pending a formal hearing.

00:01:01.009 --> 00:01:02.569
- A hearing?
- Uh-huh.

00:01:03.010 --> 00:01:05.519
Don't worry. We'll explain everything
when we get back to headquarters.

00:01:05.756 --> 00:01:08.079
Shh! Not here, Nymphadora.

00:01:09.016 --> 00:01:11.783
Don't call me Nymphadora.

00:01:18.191 --> 00:01:22.321
Stay in formation, everyone.
Don't break ranks if one of us is killed.

00:02:12.079 --> 00:02:14.164
Come on, you, around the corner.

00:02:16.208 --> 00:02:17.668
Come on.

00:02:57.082 --> 00:02:58.575
In you go, son.

00:03:00.419 --> 00:03:01.920
There've been no sightings.

00:03:02.087 --> 00:03:03.797
No deaths. No proof.

00:03:03.964 --> 00:03:06.842
He almost killed Harry.
If that isn't proof enough....

00:03:07.008 --> 00:03:10.929
Yes, but guarding
you-know-what is the most important....

00:03:13.223 --> 00:03:15.642
We must trust Dumbledore on this.

00:03:15.809 --> 00:03:17.936
Was he able to protect Harry last year?

00:03:18.103 --> 00:03:20.188
Well, tonight I say
it's time to take action.

00:03:20.355 --> 00:03:21.398
Ooh!

00:03:21.565 --> 00:03:23.608
Cornelius Fudge is a politician
first and a wizard second.

00:03:23.775 --> 00:03:26.945
- His instinct would be to ignore it--
- Shh. Keep your voices down.

00:03:27.112 --> 00:03:30.793
He's getting stronger and stronger
by the minute. We have to act now.

00:03:35.495 --> 00:03:37.359
-Harry.
-Mrs. Weasley.

00:03:40.459 --> 00:03:42.377
Heavens, you're all right.

00:03:46.465 --> 00:03:49.867
Bit peaky, but I'm afraid dinner will wait
until after the meeting's finished.

00:03:50.343 --> 00:03:54.554
Nope. No time to explain.
Straight upstairs, first door on the left.

00:03:55.849 --> 00:03:57.309
Yeah.

00:03:59.561 --> 00:04:04.775
Mudblood, werewolves, traitors, thieves.

00:04:04.941 --> 00:04:09.301
If my poor mistress
knew the scum they let into her house...

00:04:09.988 --> 00:04:12.282
...what would she say to old Kreacher?

00:04:13.325 --> 00:04:15.078
Oh, the shame.

